## {m.site_gs_dark()}

<p class="fs-docs"><I18nMarkupMessage message={m.site_gs_dark_text} /></p>

```bash
pnpm add mode-watcher
```

```svelte
<script>
  import 'fluentui-svelte/theme.css';
  import 'fluentui-svelte/class-darkmode.css';
  import { FluentUISvelte } from 'fluentui-svelte';
  import { ModeWatcher } from 'mode-watcher';

  let { children } = $props();
</script>

<ModeWatcher />
<FluentUISvelte>
  {@render children()}
</FluentUISvelte>
```

